# Universal Declaration of Human Rights by language

## to build the static site

```
ruby build-static.rb
```

## Notes

The UDHR in Unicode project was taken over by Eric Muller (the original creator), and the web content and git repo were moved to a domain he owns. The unicode.org/udhr/ path no longer hosts the files. unicode
The project now lives in two places:

* New website —  http://efele.net/udhr/ 
* GitHub repo — the repository is at https://github.com/eric-muller/udhr, where the raw source files are available under the data/ folder. 